{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>The Weeknd 上月在啟德主場館舉行了四場《 After Hours til Dawn Tour》，除了引起撲飛熱潮外，演唱會中更特別為香港站，製作了新歌《Hong Kong》，由於歌曲featuring王菲的《季候風》，The Weeknd 與王菲的歌聲亦完美配合，新歌隨即在當晚社交平台洗版，而《季候風》是王菲1993年的作品，更掀起了網友尋回九十年代的廣東歌的興趣。\n《季候風》是王菲1993年大碟《執迷不悔》曲目之一，《季候風》原由潘源良填詞、台灣著名創作人陳小霞作曲（原曲為《有一天我會》）。</p><figure><img alt=\"The Weeknd 在《Hong Kong》正式MV亦有粉墨登場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197729311696621568196275.jpeg/QRcKKA-93-PzDxGG2AGWf7OqY8xnvDDAD1zq8g9c6vI\"/><figcaption>The Weeknd 在《Hong Kong》正式MV亦有粉墨登場。</figcaption></figure><p>The Weeknd 在香港演唱會的大螢幕上播放了《Hong Kong》MV，大家都相當期待在YouTube看到正式版登場，而今晚《Hong Kong》MV正式上架， MV 由 Evan Larsen 執導，取景風格雖延續啟德演唱會螢幕上的夜幕霓虹與都市孤獨感，最大改變就是女主角，之前演唱會版MV女主角是由王柳雯擔任，但今次YouTube版MV就換上了何猷君太太奚夢瑤擔任，奚夢瑤未嫁入何家豪門前，亦是中國名模，曾經為維密天使女模之一。</p><figure><img alt=\"The Weeknd 《Hong Kong》演唱會版本女主角是王柳雯，而正式MV女主角就換上奚夢瑤。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197730689433210880589167.jpeg/apjWO5Z1tvG5V04DtmZW36ZtKt4u91YSXz2szl89rM4\"/><figcaption>The Weeknd 《Hong Kong》演唱會版本女主角是王柳雯，而正式MV女主角就換上奚夢瑤。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731375994769408928340.png/CwT1xVjGcqQsFbVqwppczyqxgbvvJpEZf7KwpH-ysKQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731373759074304395864.jpeg/9rokOgoYutX6hClwrSOfHqySS6iKgXM_Z7hne2e4Z3s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731383029010432619285.png/t0spOLPvUPR62NqweRo0ZXAw9na8XOyp-yl5LvspeS4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731380952698880608437.jpeg/FqOUacx6E6OngSA0sxtUFjFQZTAA6Z4fAik1oQIpNaE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731378415013888052198.png/V1n2pgiEeNbralooMs2MYp97sogxM3-4RwasCkcGrAo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731376271593472504678.jpeg/SZ7nSCNbpbSz8akOSVA7EUmxV2VP3G8hyqJKfsqiSn4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731373905874944384129.jpeg/hd-CImnbpIxHe_9MTITZqUyP-bkoMm0oC0OVKgtDlSo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731382773157888892047.jpeg/GMkjjhy8eFY73H6dXWmXA1wLHn67nN-FzCYW9cwmFvU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731380562628608348250.jpeg/SOJB8paKGGlhCjpenchdq_5vSrQFw3FjPZFDMj2RQzI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731378284990464620193.jpeg/iw-yXL-BxZUo4SUFsHijSvEwNHRfNs-b28kFktvJBZI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731376217067520570263.jpeg/_K_heYxLpmBSzgObFM8EYWMB-IebeH3S8P4mzPD-Jsw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197731373759074304901267.png/rr_nTDorLdRHiTjR4RWx74cpHH2UcpZMHzWtVB81rVQ\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T18:24:23.103092+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":560,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T18:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T22:17:52.878886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T18:17:51.520607+00:00","content_hash":"42cfd6b0caffd1f2f19fe39cf7cddc12e8c6ec9224e9765a39e607781a059ec9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}